  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Probability of getting score $9$ in a single throw $=\\frac{4}{36}=\\frac{1}{9}$\nProbability of getting score $9$ exactly twice $={ }^3 \\mathrm{C}_2 \\times\\left(\\frac{1}{9}\\right)^2 \\times \\frac{8}{9}=\\frac{8}{243}$.",
    "image": null
